pan><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>iter </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2000</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>warmup </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>thin </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">default</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>equal_step_sizes </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>leapfrog_steps </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>max_treedepth </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>epsilon </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>epsilon_pm </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>delta </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>gamma </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.05</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Iteration</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">    </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2000</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">%]</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Adapting</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Floating</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> point exception<br></span></div></code></div><br>I guess that it divides iterations by zero. I personally thing that refresh=0 should imply nothing should be printed.<br><br>Ben<br><br>"
